aragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Forest</strong>: Nature-tech fusion zones with bio-adaptive creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Ruins</strong>: Abandoned urban decay ruled by street gangs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrapyard</strong>: Industrial waste zones perfect for component scavenging</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Zone</strong>: Corporate-controlled factory complexes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon District</strong>: High-tech commercial centers blazing with holograms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated Swamp</strong>: Bio-hazard zones where genetic experiments roam free</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wasteland Mines</strong>: Synthetic-controlled resource extraction sites</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamancer has <strong>four factions</strong> that are constantly battling for territory on the world map. The factions are split into two alliance blocks that the player can align themselves with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As faction territories change, the maps change too. Factions leave a physical mark on the map with strongholds at the centers of their territory.\u00a0Sometimes you'll see the alliances fighting against each other on world tiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The factions are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Street Runner's Alliance</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Bio-Adaptive Commune</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthetic Collective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Security Force</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha